<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS starts drug development firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS starts drug development firms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Christine Bennis initiated coverage of Parexel International Corp with a strong buy rating and set a 12-month price target of $43 a share.</p>
<p>-- said started Covance Inc with a buy rating and set a 12-month price target of $25 a share.</p>
<p>-- started Quintiles Transnational Corp with a buy rating and a $90 price target.</p>
<p>-- started ClinTrials Research Inc and Pharmaceutical Product Development Inc with hold ratings.</p>
</text>
